<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Quark collects, uses and protects personal information." updated="January 15, 2026">
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, organization and message when you
    use our contact form, subscribe to updates or apply for a role. We also collect limited technical information
    automatically, including IP address, browser type and pages visited.
  </p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to inquiries and provide requested information</li>
    <li>To evaluate job applications</li>
    <li>To send updates you have subscribed to</li>
    <li>To operate, secure and improve this website</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations, including export control requirements</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell personal information. We share it only with service providers who process it on our behalf under
    contract, or where required by law.
  </p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain personal information only as long as needed for the purposes described above or as required by law.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct or delete your personal information. To exercise
    these rights, contact <a href="mailto:privacy@quark.energy">privacy@quark.energy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>See our <a href="/cookie">Cookie Notice</a> for details on the cookies this site uses.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects the latest revision.</p>
</LegalLayout>
